  <reporting-org ref="NL-KVK-40409352" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands Red Cross</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-2 MOFA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the National COVID-19 prevention and control efforts through increased knowledge among the general population, improved COVID-19 hygiene / health practices and provision of psychosocial support by the end of September 2021.
Update July 2021: In July 2021 a top up of the project has been approved: the top will mainly be used to support Ethiopian Government in the COVID-19 vaccination. 
Update November 2021: DRU agreed to extend the deadline fo the COVID campaign funds from 31-12-2021 until 30-4-2022


Specific Objectives
&#x2022;	To increase awareness among the target communities on COVID-19 transmission routes, prevention techniques through risk communication, mass sensitization, demonstration
&#x2022;	To reduce the spread of the virus by intensifying Covid-19 prevention  practices 
&#x2022;	To mitigate the impact of Covid-19 on mental health and access to health care through provision of PSS support as well as CBHFA+ activities
&#x2022;	To strengthen the capacity of ERCS branch staff ( 30) and volunteers (200) on Covid-19 , prevention and response (through  provision of training/orientation).</narrative>
  </description>
